Public keys that may sign the plugin catalogue index, one file per key:
<keyId>.pub, one line with the standard base64 of the 32 raw Ed25519 key bytes.
<keyId> is the first 16 hex characters of the SHA-256 of those bytes.

Every file here is compiled into the binary. With no key, corsarr refuses
every catalogue. To rotate, add the new key one release before the index is
signed with it, then remove the old one.

    go run ./scripts/pluginindex keygen <dir>   # writes index-key.pem and <keyId>.pub
